note.p:
Source: National Archives, RG 59, Office of Southern Europe, Records of Counselor
                    Nimetz, 1977–1980, Lot 83D256, Box 1, POL 2 Cyprus 1977 and 1978. Confidential;
                    Exdis. Drafted by Chapman; cleared by Ewing and Stanislaus R.P. Valerga (S/S–O);
                    approved by Nimetz. Sent for information to Ankara, Athens, London, and USUN.
                    Nimetz was in New York to attend the UN Special Session on Disarmament.
